        "exposedClass": "informational",
        "statement": "No operational consequence for existing setups: the field is optional and, when unset, service discovery defaults to the value defined in the Prometheus/PrometheusAgent resource, so existing ServiceMonitors continue to work unchanged; operators may optionally set the new field to 'Endpoints' or 'EndpointSlice'.",
