      "statement": "The monitoring.coreos.com/v1 ServiceMonitor CRD schema gained a new optional field spec.serviceDiscoveryRole, a string enum accepting \"Endpoints\" or \"EndpointSlice\" that defines the service discovery role used to discover targets and otherwise defaults to the value defined in the Prometheus/PrometheusAgent resource."
